  user_1,How much is the fee
  user_2,The reinstatement fee is $250 plus a $75 late fee and your new annual premium is $1,200
  user_1,That's a bit more than I expected [pause] Can you hold for a minute
  user_2,Of course Sai [hold music plays for 2 minutes]
